; Run 3 on OPS-SAT PRETTY (exp4051), version 2, segment 3: the shrinking
; quorum with the manager's state file, each replica in a process of its own.
;   cycle 200  replica 1 returns the same wrong value: outvoted on cycles
;              200, 201 and 202, fails its known-answer test and is retired
; The state file is saved on every change and, set here by command, every
; 100 cycles. The entry script then kills the manager process without
; warning (SIGKILL); its replica processes see their links close and end.
; The manager is started again with no sequence and new replica processes:
; it restores the policy, the slots (replica 1 retired) and the cycle
; counter from the file.
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.manager.SET_POLICY SHRINK
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.manager.STATESAVEPERIOD_PRM_SET 100
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.SET_UPSETS 0.0 0.05 1
R00:00:00 MruQuorum.injector.INJECT STUCK 1 200
